@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@clientId = 15390
@remissionId = 7100000000000
@remissionNumber = FAW00000001
@bankAccountId = 6610
@revision = 1
@date = 2026-11-23
@requestKey = 492a068e-eba4-4cae-ae39-1292c709ad7c
@policyNumber = 1CW00000001

### Consultar saldo y cuentas disponibles
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-receivable/clients/{{clientId}}/collections/{{remissionId}}

### Registrar un abono de prueba. Usar la revisión del GET y una clave nueva para cada cobro.
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts-receivable/clients/{{clientId}}/collections/{{remissionId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestKey": "{{requestKey}}",
  "revision": {{revision}},
  "bankAccountId": {{bankAccountId}},
  "amount": 40,
  "date": "{{date}}",
  "reference": "DEP-PRUEBA-01",
  "description": "Abono de prueba"
}

### Consultar el saldo restante
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-receivable/clients/{{clientId}}/balance?q={{remissionNumber}}

### Consultar los depósitos de la cuenta
GET {{baseUrl}}/treasury/bank-accounts/{{bankAccountId}}/actions/deposits

### Abrir la póliza devuelta al cobrar
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/policies/by-number/{{policyNumber}}
